#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1032
msgid ""
"Let marking, matching selections and entity cards recognize entities that "
"first appear past your installed X-Ray coverage, using the checkpoint "
"already built ahead of you. Identification only: such names get short-dash "
"marks and a brief card, and the full entry stays behind a spoiler "
"confirmation. Off = the plugin only knows entities up to your installed "
"coverage."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1045
msgid "Entity Card First"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1048
msgid ""
"Exact entity hits (tapping a marked word, or selecting text that matches an "
